          %h2#references References
          %p Lecture notes include:
          %ul
            %li#Blumberg17
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Blumberg"}> Andrew Blumberg
              , section 3.1 of
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Burnside category
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.ma.utexas.edu/users/a.debray/lecture_notes/m392c_EHT_notes.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://github.com/adebray/equivariant_homotopy_theory"} GitHub
          %p
            The spectrally-enriched version and its role in the equivalent description of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-spectra"} G-spectra
            via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectral+Mackey+functors"} spectral Mackey functors
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#GuillouMay11
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bert+Guillou"}> Bert Guillou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"} Peter May
              %em
                Models of
                = succeed "-spectra" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi G
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1110.3571"} arXiv:1110.3571
          %p A beautified review is given in
          %ul
            %li#BohmannOsorno14
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anna+Marie+Bohmann"}> Anna Marie Bohmann
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ang%C3%A9lica+Osorno"} Angélica Osorno
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructing equivariant spectra via categorical Mackey functors
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1405.6126"} arXiv:1405.6126
          %p making use of
          %ul
            %li#Guillout10
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bertrand+Guillou"}> Bertrand Guillou
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Strictification of categories weakly enriched in symmetric monoidal categories
